<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on ABB.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on ABB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of ABB AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,400 CHF		 PREMIUM	18.82 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.26 CHF		  GEARING	9.78 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 15.JUL.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	14.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2,210 CHF  NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
